OL,3,GNEWSAGnome-care: Butchers shop becomes
OL,4,Afigurine hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired butcher has swapped his meat
OL,7,Fcleaver for a paintbrush as he turns
OL,8,Fhis hand to a spot of gnome
OL,9,Fimprovement.
OL,11,FAlistair Dent opened the gnome hospital
OL,12,F18 months ago in his former butcher's
OL,13,Fshop in Hilgay near Downham Market,
OL,14,FNorfolk. He now displays the ceramic
OL,15,Ffigures in the refrigerated meat
OL,16,Fcounters.
OL,18,FOnce donated to Dent, the gnomes are
OL,19,Fgiven figurine first-aid: cleaned up,
OL,20,Frestored, repainted, sealed to protect
OL,21,Fthem from the weather and then resold -
OL,22,Fwith proceeds going to charity.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
