OL,3,GNEWSAGnome-care: Butchers shop becomes
OL,4,Afigurine hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I always find if you buy a gnome and
OL,7,Flike a gnome you are usually a happy
OL,8,Fperson. Gnomes are very good luck, you
OL,9,Flook at one and think what a lovely
OL,10,Fface. My wife says I look like a
OL,11,Fgnome," he said.
